{"id":"n24080-1-7","stage":3,"title":"의식 · 意识","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24080-1-7-1","ko":"너희 학교 뉴스에 나오더라?","zh":"我看到你们学校上新闻了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"2","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뉴스에","meaning":"新闻","explanation":"뉴스：新闻；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"뉴스","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32795","senseId":"1","lemma":"뉴스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나오더라?","meaning":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","explanation":"나오다：被刊登，被播放，被记载；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"4","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代包括听者在内的多数人，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"5ac661dbed5720ae","term":"뉴스","zh":"新闻","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3","entryId":"32795","definition":"报道新消息的电视、广播节目。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在书籍、报纸、广播电视等上登载文章、画作或出现某种内容。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/42e86ccdf84c45fa1842.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24080-1-7-2","ko":"응. 급식을 잘못 먹고 몇몇 학생들이 의식을 잃었지 뭐야.","zh":"嗯，吃了有问题的学校供餐，几个学生失去了意识。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"급식을","meaning":"供应伙食，供餐，供食","explanation":"급식：供应伙食，供餐，供食；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"급식","audio":"/audio/b96e814e821f04ede4f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41410","senseId":"1","lemma":"급식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘못","meaning":"正确地，善良地；不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"잘：正确地，善良地；못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"},{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"7","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇몇","meaning":"几，一些","explanation":"몇몇：几，一些","readings":[{"term":"몇몇","audio":"/audio/7478b27eb1768980dce1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62624","senseId":"1","lemma":"몇몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학생들이","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의식을","meaning":"意识","explanation":"의식：意识；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"의식","audio":"/audio/2a45b0dd02cce2315c70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24080","senseId":"1","lemma":"의식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잃었지","meaning":"失去","explanation":"잃다：失去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"7","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐야.","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"b96e814e821f04ed","term":"급식","zh":"供应伙食，供餐，供食","audio":"/audio/b96e814e821f04ede4f1.mp3","entryId":"41410","definition":"在机关内为一定的对象提供饮食；或所那些饮食。","pronunciation":["급씩"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"正确地，善良地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"端正和善地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"7478b27eb1768980","term":"몇몇","zh":"几，一些","audio":"/audio/7478b27eb1768980dce1.mp3","entryId":"62624","definition":"(强调)数目不定的小数字。","pronunciation":["면멷"]},{"id":"f24650b42089c29f","term":"학생","zh":"学生","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3","entryId":"31670","definition":"在学校学习的人。","pronunciation":["학쌩"]},{"id":"2a45b0dd02cce231","term":"의식","zh":"意识","audio":"/audio/2a45b0dd02cce2315c70.mp3","entryId":"24080","definition":"精神清醒状态时能够感觉或认知事物的机能。","pronunciation":["의ː식"]},{"id":"03ebbd29f2834d52","term":"잃다","zh":"失去","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3","entryId":"17177","definition":"意识、感情、精力或生理现象等消失。","pronunciation":["일타"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/04dd20701288c22dfa65.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.894,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24080","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":96,"sequenceScore":2.5474,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，吃了有问题的学校供餐，几个学生失去了意识。","我看到你们学校上新闻了？","哎呀，快看这只猫的尾巴在摇呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我看到你们学校上新闻了？","哎呀，快看这只猫的尾巴在摇呢。","嗯，吃了有问题的学校供餐，几个学生失去了意识。"],"answer":2}]}
